[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesLayoutResX: 1920LayoutResY: 1080YCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Narrator-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,300,300,27,1Style: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Captions-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Warning,Impress BT Pace,90,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,105,105,1.5,0,1,3.7,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Note-207+,Impress BT Pace,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H96000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.75,3.75,8,300,300,27,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:02:00.09,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:02:07.02,0:02:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She jumped off into the Backstreets!Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.53,0:02:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Wait! – Don't go down there!Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.07,0:02:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go after her!Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.33,0:02:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Paulie!Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.58,0:02:21.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of you rushing off isn't going to save her!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.08,0:02:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...!Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.16,0:02:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the sea we're up against!Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll just wind up the same as her!Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If something happens, I'll take care of it.Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.84,0:02:31.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To think she'd run straight into danger...Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.01,0:02:32.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That girl is something else!Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.59,0:02:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiots! Be impressed later!Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.72,0:02:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get back here right now!Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.05,0:02:39.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be swallowed by the sea!Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.18,0:02:40.97,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A sea anemone...Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.02,0:02:47.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A sea anemone...Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.27,0:02:50.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A sea anemone is coming out of a chimney.Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why a sea anemone?Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.53,0:02:54.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A sea anemone?Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.59,0:03:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, reindeer! Not you, too!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.34,0:03:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.97,0:03:20.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate lady! You're so amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So impetuous!Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.73,0:03:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way she'll make it back in time!Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just look offshore!Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.06,0:03:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wave's already right there!Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.15,0:03:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad! They're done for!Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.65,0:03:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no saving them now!Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.66,0:03:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's me!Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper?Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use...Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't go any further.Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.68,0:04:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.11,0:04:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing there?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.74,0:04:20.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Nami! Are you behind me?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, hey, listen!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.95,0:04:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See, that pigeon jerk sent me flying, and I got stuck in this gap.Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.39,0:04:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit messing around at a time like this!Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.02,0:04:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While you've been goofing off, Robin was taken away!Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.78,0:05:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin's giving up her life for us!Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.00,0:05:17.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She sacrificed herself to protect us from the government!Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.01,0:05:21.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I have nowhere to go and no home to return to.Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No. We're through.Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.47,0:05:25.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll never see me again.Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.93,0:05:30.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even though she knew that being taken away would mean her death!Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.65,0:05:37.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin was...Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lying all along?Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.53,0:05:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad...Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.46,0:05:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.38,0:05:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let Robin die!Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.09,0:05:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that wave!Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.59,0:06:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?! It's so much bigger than usual!Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.05,0:06:05.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! This is seriously bad!Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.47,0:06:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate woman! Give up and run already!Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.27,0:06:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm being torn apart!Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really stuck in there!Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.81,0:06:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you manage to get stuck in there, Zoro?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.98,0:06:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit pulling on me!Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.12,0:06:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?! That huge wave is almost here!Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.33,0:06:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"What are we gonna do", huh?Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec.Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.21,0:06:41.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you carrying Kitetsu by any chance?Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Your sword?Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.97,0:06:44.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have it.Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.59,0:06:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since that one's cursed, I can tell when it's around.Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you kept it for me, Chopper?Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.72,0:06:52.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks.Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put it in my hand! Quick!Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.85,0:06:56.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make a run for it!Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.85,0:07:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to climb up high! Get to high ground!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.94,0:07:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use! They're done for!Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.78,0:07:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be swallowed!Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.66,0:07:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is here!Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this...?Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it!Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.50,0:08:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! He busted up those buildings!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.81,0:08:17.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.10,0:08:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay back, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.31,0:08:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One-Sword Style:Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.81,0:08:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Six-Pound Phoenix!Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are they?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.12,0:08:37.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.38,0:08:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rumble! Jumping Point!Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.76,0:08:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on to me, Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.35,0:08:58.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Backstreets are...!Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.37,0:09:16.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.33,0:09:17.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that!Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's them!Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.18,0:09:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! You made it!Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.39,0:09:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll be safe on the bridge.Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.31,0:09:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even that enormous wave won't reach them there.Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.77,0:09:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.36,0:09:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice job, you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.58,0:10:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's come this far!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to the Straw Hats?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.75,0:10:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did Aqua Laguna swallow them?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.80,0:10:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, look at that!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.14,0:10:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Paulie!Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.27,0:10:29.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.25,0:10:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not in the clear yet! Run!Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.84,0:10:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run to Shipyard Island!Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.09,0:10:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bridge is collapsing!Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a wave...Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.67,0:11:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Unbelievable... This is Shipyard Island!Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.51,0:11:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even here, I don't feel safe.Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.93,0:11:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! The tide is ebbing again.Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course it is, meaning there'll be more to come!Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.98,0:11:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A second wave... Then a third...Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.35,0:11:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like the first one!Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.31,0:11:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should flee to higher ground as well!Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.45,0:12:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously... That was reckless!Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.91,0:12:06.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks. You saved us, rope guy.Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.75,0:12:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was shocked!Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's Aqua Laguna...Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stop shaking.Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.42,0:12:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it was that big every year, the whole island would be long gone.Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.51,0:12:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's different this year.Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.14,0:12:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bunch are crazy!Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.89,0:12:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you survived.Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Old monster lady!Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.94,0:12:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you were on this island?Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.19,0:12:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we stayed in the middle of that ocean, we'd drown!Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.94,0:12:38.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate guy!Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.61,0:12:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were incredible! Like, wham!Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.95,0:12:43.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I kinda was.Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to suffocate me?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.54,0:12:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This moron passed out while latched onto me.Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.55,0:12:56.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...?Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.34,0:12:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Zoro, why were you also running from the wave?Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.93,0:13:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Were you in the Backstreets?Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.39,0:13:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well... Not exactly...Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.14,0:13:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got stuck in a chimney.Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.77,0:13:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stuck in a chimney?Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you're so careless!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.40,0:13:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you get yourself in that kind of–Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.65,0:13:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And who are you to be laughing at others?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're both super careless!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.53,0:13:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, what happened to Sanji and Uso–Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.37,0:13:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, Sanji?Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.16,0:13:29.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right...Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.33,0:13:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a lot to catch you up on. Zoro, you listen too.Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.01,0:13:42.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my big chance.Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.59,0:13:46.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With a buster call, we can urgently summonDialogue: 50,0:13:46.35,0:13:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,five vice admirals from Marine Headquarters along with ten battleships.Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.89,0:13:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to Aokiji for giving us, CP9, the authority to execute it.Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.98,0:14:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Funkfreed?Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.53,0:14:07.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, the woman whom the World GovernmentDialogue: 50,0:14:07.70,0:14:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,pursued for twenty years, has fallen straight into CP9's hands.Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.75,0:14:16.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At the same time, we're also hauling in that rotten Cutty Flam,Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.38,0:14:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's disciple who possesses the blueprints for Pluton.Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.01,0:14:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In this vast world, they're the only two humans holding the keys to reviving that ancient weapon.Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.80,0:14:31.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're on the sea train, heading toward me this very moment...Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.35,0:14:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That world-shattering armament is headed my way.Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.28,0:14:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to think about.Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.41,0:14:50.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's sail after them right away!Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's our only choice.Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.42,0:15:01.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, rope guy.Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.46,0:15:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please lend us a ship.Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.67,0:15:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, instead of a ship, are there other sea trains leaving?Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.76,0:15:12.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Puffing Tom is the world's one and only sea train.Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.02,0:15:14.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a miraculous ship that is the resultDialogue: 50,0:15:14.94,0:15:18.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the combined efforts of the legendary Tom's Workers.Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.44,0:15:22.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, let us borrow a ship.Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The strongest and fastest one in this town!Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.82,0:15:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough already, you idiots!Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.82,0:15:31.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you paying attention just now?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.12,0:15:34.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were almost pulled out to sea by that wave!Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.41,0:15:37.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right! There's no way you can set out to sea right now!Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.88,0:15:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.75,0:15:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No ship has made it through even the usual Aqua Laguna!Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saw the Backstreets collapse, right?Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.05,0:15:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This town, which has always endured Aqua Laguna...Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.89,0:15:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is now in ruins.Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.14,0:15:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the Aqua Laguna this year is unfathomably huge.Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.77,0:15:59.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you set out in a ship now, even if you braved it in the largest galleon,Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.94,0:16:02.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your ship would be destroyed in an instant.Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.07,0:16:06.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't let you sail out knowing  I'm sending you to your deaths.Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.24,0:16:08.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait until morning.Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.24,0:16:12.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After the storm, I'll lend you a ship.Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.20,0:16:16.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys. Go to the evacuation site or someplace.Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're done searching for people.Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.58,0:16:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If...Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.42,0:16:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we wait until morning, do we have any chance of success?Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.97,0:16:32.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know all about Enies Lobby.Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.55,0:16:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I heard it was  a government island, I remembered...Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.56,0:16:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that...Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.89,0:16:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the place where the Gates of Justice are?Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.15,0:16:42.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.15,0:16:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby is the government-owned  Judicial Island.Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.74,0:16:50.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that island is a court in name alone.Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.78,0:16:55.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Being taken to Enies Lobby itself is considered to be proof of guilt.Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.04,0:16:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After passing through this  empty courthouse uninterrupted,Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.41,0:17:03.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,criminals soon reach huge, cold steel doors.Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.88,0:17:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These doors are called the Gates of Justice.Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.47,0:17:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once criminals go through them,Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.39,0:17:15.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll never see the sunlight again. They're doors of despair.Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.01,0:17:20.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After sailing from the harbor beyond those gates,Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.35,0:17:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there are only two places you can reach.Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.19,0:17:28.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One is considered the mightiest summit of the forces of justice in the world:Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.86,0:17:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marine Headquarters.Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.57,0:17:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other is the enormous undersea prison, Impel Down,Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.16,0:17:39.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,home to vicious prisoners who once ran amok all over the world,Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.37,0:17:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where torture rooms and gallows stand side by side.Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To put it simply,Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.29,0:17:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby is just a hollow imitation of justice,Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.42,0:17:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where criminals are condemned with no hope for mercy.Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.93,0:17:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin's got a bounty on her head.Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.76,0:18:00.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter her destination, only hell awaits her!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.85,0:18:05.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every second we waste talking, she gets closer to the Gates of Justice!Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.73,0:18:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can wait until morning!Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.19,0:18:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you know that much, I've got only one thing to say.Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.91,0:18:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if the sea were calm and you were able to sail out,Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.74,0:18:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you should never go there.Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.16,0:18:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that you guys are also pirates.Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.58,0:18:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like you said, Enies Lobby is the front door to the hub of the World Government.Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.71,0:18:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally, taking that into account, it's heavily fortified.Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.59,0:18:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No pirate would dream of rescuing a crew member taken to that island...Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because the outcome is certain.Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.06,0:18:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to pick a fight in the very heart of the World Government?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.90,0:18:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-He's right! You should give up!Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.78,0:18:56.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna won't let you sail until morning!Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.95,0:18:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll die just going after them!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no chance of you guys surviving!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.95,0:19:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.83,0:19:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll...Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,steal a ship and go!Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.59,0:19:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna sail out now!Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.09,0:19:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our friend is waiting!Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.89,0:19:21.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't stand in our way!Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.69,0:19:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-The wave got angry too!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.65,0:19:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Wha...? – Does he wanna fight?Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.40,0:19:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy, that scared me.Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.36,0:19:38.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll take you on!Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.63,0:19:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miss Kokoro!Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.92,0:19:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's you who's wrong here, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.80,0:19:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie is right, you idiot.Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.47,0:20:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! It's none of–Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.89,0:20:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of my business... huh?Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.10,0:20:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we left you to it, you'd happily rush right to your deaths.Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look.Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.02,0:20:14.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there exists a ship that can get through that Aqua Laguna,Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.78,0:20:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it could only be a sea train built by a legendary man.Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.78,0:20:21.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's not here right now!Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why we're trying to go in a ship!Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.75,0:20:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're prepared to die...Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then come with me.Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a ride...Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.09,0:20:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on a sea train!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.61,0:21:01.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiots! What are you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.57,0:21:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone not in a uniform must be a criminal!Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,G-Get him!Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.50,0:21:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it turns out this way anyway, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.22,0:21:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I had a good plan...Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.22,0:21:29.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Operation Play Innocent"...Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! S-Sanji?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.40,0:21:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hold it! – Hold it!Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.49,0:21:41.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– We won't let you pass. – We won't let you pass.Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.45,0:21:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twins, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.21,0:21:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Collier...Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.63,0:21:55.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frite!Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.93,0:22:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Why are you on the sea train?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.39,0:22:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same question.Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.86,0:22:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what's the story, uh...Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.27,0:22:19.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,person whose name I definitely don't know?Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.61,0:22:22.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, cut the crap, jerk!Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.95,0:22:28.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There we go! Transponder snails!Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.20,0:22:29.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.83,0:22:32.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There sure are a lot over here.Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.16,0:22:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Probably the communications car...Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.21,0:22:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those officials from the car earlier only had junk like masks and costumes!Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I can finally contact Nami.Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.59,0:22:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you two are pirate crewmates, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.10,0:22:48.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Former crewmates. – Former crewmates.Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.56,0:22:50.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.06,0:22:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Franky the dismantler, boss of the Water Seven underworld.Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.98,0:22:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're Franky?! You damn bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.98,0:23:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you to put our Long Nose through hell?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.94,0:23:05.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many pieces should  I chop you into, asshole?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.57,0:23:07.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, no, no, no, no, no...Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.20,0:23:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Sanji, hold on a sec. All sorts of things happened after that.Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.58,0:23:13.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Just you wait until I'm free!Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.75,0:23:16.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got to stop mouthing off like that!Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.50,0:23:20.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, he saved the Merry once.Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.71,0:23:23.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right...Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.09,0:23:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Merry is...Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.76,0:23:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hold on! This is no time to start moping!Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.39,0:23:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, bro! Please untie me!Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.60,0:23:39.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who'd untie you?! A thug like you should stay like that forever!Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.40,0:23:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You asshole! I asked nicely, and this is how you respond?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.49,0:23:46.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it! You guys!Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.11,0:23:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry up, they'll find us, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.95,0:23:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're pissing me off!Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.45,0:23:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.58,0:23:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, both of you!Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.08,0:23:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just untie me already!Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.80,0:24:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone...Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.43,0:24:11.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This warehouse has been abandoned for more than eight years.Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.22,0:24:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the sea train itself has been untouched for more than twelve.Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.23,0:24:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.48,0:24:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.56,0:24:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, it might not even work anymore!Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.82,0:24:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! That would be a problem!Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.99,0:24:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, wait for me.Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.37,0:24:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you rush ahead, you'll need the keys to get in.Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.25,0:24:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's already open?Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.92,0:24:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There it is!Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.80,0:24:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks awesome!Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.17,0:24:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.64,0:24:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, this is one crazy train.Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.60,0:24:58.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its name is Rocketman.Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.31,0:25:01.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way we could let paying passengers on this one.Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.81,0:25:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocketman!Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.19,0:25:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sounds fast!Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.77,0:25:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool!Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.78,0:25:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with the face?Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.15,0:25:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The shark head is attached as a joke.Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.08,0:25:16.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceboss!Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.95,0:25:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.37,0:25:20.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're okay after all.Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.33,0:25:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like that pirate girl said...Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.92,0:25:25.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miss Kokoro, you brought them?Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.46,0:25:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess you survived, then, Iceburg?Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.67,0:25:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.22,0:25:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we're both here,  it must be for the same reason.Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.35,0:25:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't resist helping fools, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.69,0:25:44.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use it.Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.15,0:25:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've finished servicing it.Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.94,0:25:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I loaded water and coal, and it's building steam now.Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.95,0:25:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you were getting it ready for us, boss?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.91,0:25:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save the celebration for after you survive.Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.37,0:26:03.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how much maintenance it gets, the steam engine can't limit its speed.Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.50,0:26:06.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a failure from before we finished Puffing Tom.Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.05,0:26:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't guarantee your lives.Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.42,0:26:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No sweat! Thanks, Iceboss!Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.80,0:26:17.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.52,0:26:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! Get on board!Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.89,0:26:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lady! We're leaving as soon as Nami comes!Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.39,0:26:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.02,0:26:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Are you okay?Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.23,0:26:32.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been shaky on your feet for a while.Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.03,0:26:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He probably lost too much blood.Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.91,0:26:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm kinda out of energy. If only we had some meat...Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.58,0:26:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! This way!Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.58,0:26:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.58,0:26:47.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you need to go to a place like that? Can't you just eat here?Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.96,0:26:50.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! Aren't you starving?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.13,0:26:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As if I could eat all that!Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.76,0:26:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.34,0:26:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait!Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.68,0:26:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami?Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.51,0:26:57.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.89,0:26:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get on board, you idiot!Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.01,0:27:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.93,0:27:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is a sea train, too?Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.52,0:27:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa... I had no idea there was one in a place like this.Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.31,0:27:08.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.90,0:27:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where've you been, Nami?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.53,0:27:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it you who said to hurry up?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.11,0:27:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what's all that stuff?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.45,0:27:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meat and drinks.Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.66,0:27:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I complained.Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.16,0:27:20.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go.Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.91,0:27:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, If you can make it onto the railway after getting out to sea via the canal, that'll be a start.Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.71,0:27:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.04,0:27:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Between us, I'm the more experienced engineer.Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.17,0:27:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You take it easy and rest here.Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.38,0:27:35.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.38,0:27:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney and Gonbe should be playing over there somewhere.Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.47,0:27:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care of them for me.Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.10,0:27:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.15,0:27:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're...Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.52,0:27:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the Franky Family!Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.95,0:27:57.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At a busy time like this...!Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.78,0:28:00.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.03,0:28:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,take us with you!Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.58,0:28:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard from the Galley-La people that you're going to Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.83,0:28:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our Bro, Franky,  was taken by the government!Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.09,0:28:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We want to go after them...Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.17,0:28:16.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we can't get through Aqua Laguna by ourselves!Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.38,0:28:18.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the World Government you're up against.Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.34,0:28:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who it is!Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.51,0:28:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get Bro back!Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.35,0:28:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd give up our lives for him!Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.06,0:28:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please!Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.44,0:28:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help us out!Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.52,0:28:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.94,0:28:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please! Bro is in danger!Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.24,0:28:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.11,0:28:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've put us through?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.83,0:28:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We do!Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.83,0:28:53.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're swallowing our pride and begging you!Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.00,0:28:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We want to save Bro!Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.02,0:29:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get on.Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.44,0:29:13.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.99,0:29:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.49,0:29:22.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.45,0:29:24.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it'll be fine.Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.49,0:29:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.91,0:29:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're deeply indebted to you!Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.46,0:29:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.96,0:29:34.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we don't have to get on the train!Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.59,0:29:40.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll jump out to sea on our king bulls when you do!Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.97,0:29:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just let us hitch a ride on the back of your train.Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.22,0:29:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King bulls?Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.72,0:29:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting us come!Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.27,0:29:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, see you later!Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.77,0:29:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.27,0:29:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.11,0:30:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! We can go rescue Bro!Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.45,0:30:06.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.54,0:30:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's this?Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.92,0:30:18.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.13,0:30:20.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, shall we?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.17,0:31:00.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.88,0:31:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go getting thrown off, okay?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.35,0:31:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now departing Water Seven for Enies Lobby...Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.86,0:31:22.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here comes the sea train Rocketman!Dialogue: 50,0:31:26.03,0:31:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! We're off!Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.25,0:31:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go...Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.12,0:31:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and take everything back!Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:56.18,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua LagunaDialogue: 1,0:01:52.13,0:01:56.18,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua LagunaDialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:42.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car 7 (Last Car)Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.13,0:20:42.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car 7 (Last Car)Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.13,0:20:42.51,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car 7 (Last Car)Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:55.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car 6 (Freight Car)Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.44,0:20:55.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car 6 (Freight Car)Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.44,0:20:55.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car 6 (Freight Car)Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:16.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Red Brick Warehouse Behind the Waste FacilityDialogue: 1,0:24:11.68,0:24:16.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Red Brick Warehouse Behind the Waste FacilityDialogue: 1,0:24:11.68,0:24:16.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Red Brick Warehouse Behind the Waste FacilityDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00